Runner-1 executes at T=2s, 12s, 22s...
Runner-2 executes at T=4s, 14s, 24s...
Runner-3 executes at T=6s, 16s, 26s...
Runner-4 executes at T=8s, 18s, 28s...<p>Time-Division Multiple Access (TDMA). Same pattern GSM uses for radio.<p>GO IMPLEMENTATION<p>type Runner struct {
    ID, TotalRunners int
    CycleTime time.Duration
}<p>func (r <i>Runner) Start() {
